      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相对于名为“经典三冠路线”的“主轴”，\n有一个以全新视角形成的参赛计划构想──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b79de62a01e8cd13b992ea8038dfe358ca0c1ed514f228557aca2dc702ed2870",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
