    {
      "uid": "zhcn:593196cea3e8d9f884578028",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，说来简单。要实现这个参赛计划\n有许多困难之处。不用说距离资质这种\n天生的部分，最大的问题是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2844e78a003f841ab1447bf8f9ca634f4d17afa77b4b20d48c2440471b82d4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:900c48bf568d0f4bdef94052",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084100.json",
      "json_path": [
