    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:031b2591b7443e8ecb635ea0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能使吾的光芒变得鲜明耀眼的\n并非是阳光充沛的安稳之地，\n而是乌云密布的艰困环境！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2504b666fbb2a446aea23269931ac5788940f091cd363069f2090bbbbae3f20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
